          "content": "· ≥ 1280：侧栏 248 + 主区 + 需求进度 360 三栏",
          "lineHeight": 1.6,
          "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
          "fontSize": 13,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "ugWwY",
          "name": "Text",
          "fill": "#A1A1A8",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": 470,
          "content": "· 1024–1279：需求进度改为右侧抽屉，由标题栏“需求进度 · 阶段”按钮打开",
          "lineHeight": 1.6,
          "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
          "fontSize": 13,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "m4NJ1I",
          "name": "Text",
          "fill": "#A1A1A8",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": 470,
          "content": "· < 1024：侧栏收为 56 图标栏；项目悬停展开浮层树，Main 提问提示点显示在项目图标上",
          "lineHeight": 1.6,
          "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
          "fontSize": 13,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "C1MmF",
          "name": "Text",
          "fill": "#A1A1A8",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": 470,
          "content": "· Web 窄屏（< 640）：单栏，侧栏与需求进度均为全屏抽屉",
          "lineHeight": 1.6,
          "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
          "fontSize": 13,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "Dhfrw",
          "name": "Text",
          "fill": "#A1A1A8",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": 470,
          "content": "· Web 端无系统窗口材质，背景使用与深浅主题对应的渐变底图",
          "lineHeight": 1.6,
          "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
          "fontSize": 13,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "iKaVV",
          "name": "Text",
          "fill": "#A1A1A8",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": 470,
          "content": "· 减少动态效果开启：脉冲泳道停止滚动、改为每 10 秒刷新的静态快照；面板与抽屉取消位移动画，仅保留透明度过渡；加载图标改为静态省略号",
          "lineHeight": 1.6,
          "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
          "fontSize": 13,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        }
      ]
    },
