      "padding": 28,
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "QdJ2X",
          "name": "Note",
          "fill": "#ECECEE",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "打磨 14 + 18 · 待确认",
          "lineHeight": 1.6,
          "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
          "fontSize": 18,
          "fontWeight": "600"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "o1MQI",
          "name": "Note",
          "fill": "#ECECEE",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "第 14 条 · 回复操作栏",
          "lineHeight": 1.6,
          "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "500"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "tNU7R",
          "name": "Note",
          "fill": "#A8A8AF",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "• 每条回复结束后显示：复制（整条 Markdown）、Fork（从这条回复分叉出新会话，只带对话历史）、时间 18:50。\n• 鼠标移到时间上显示完整日期和秒。\n• 操作栏平时半透明，鼠标移到这条回复上时变清晰；最后一条回复始终清晰。\n• 运行中的回复不显示操作栏。",
          "lineHeight": 1.6,
          "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
          "fontSize": 13,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "VSFcJ",
          "name": "Note",
          "fill": "#ECECEE",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "第 18 条 · 渲染组件",
          "lineHeight": 1.6,
          "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "500"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "BIofz",
          "name": "Note",
          "fill": "#A8A8AF",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "• 工具按钮统一放在组件的标题行右侧，平时只显示语言或文件名，悬停时出现按钮。\n• 文件芯片：按扩展名显示图标和颜色，带行号时点击定位到该行。\n• Diff：默认内联，可以切换为并排；超过 40 行默认折叠。\n• 数学公式已经用 KaTeX 离线渲染，样式按此稿微调即可。Mermaid 是新增的，同样离线渲染，失败时退回显示源码。\n• 终端输出默认显示前 12 行，其余折叠；保留 ANSI 颜色，退出码非 0 时标红。",
          "lineHeight": 1.6,
          "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
          "fontSize": 13,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "FXKX7",
          "name": "Note",
          "fill": "#5BD08A",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "已确认",
          "lineHeight": 1.6,
          "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "500"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "F0PnQC",
          "name": "Note",
          "fill": "#A8A8AF",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "已确认（2026-11-11）：操作栏平时半透明、悬停变清晰；Diff 默认内联；Mermaid 新增依赖，按需加载。",
          "lineHeight": 1.6,
          "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
          "fontSize": 13,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        }
      ]
    },
