    {
      "type": "frame",
      "id": "HSkpV",
      "x": 1540,
      "y": 14756,
      "name": "说明 · 打磨 27",
      "width": 440,
      "fill": "#1c1c20",
      "cornerRadius": 12,
      "layout": "vertical",
      "gap": 10,
      "padding": 24,
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "Ysspe",
          "name": "H",
          "fill": "#ededef",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "打磨 27 · 已确认（档位随模型、滑块方案 B）",
          "lineHeight": 1.6,
          "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
          "fontSize": 16,
          "fontWeight": "600"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "KQaqI",
          "name": "P",
          "fill": "#a1a1a8",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "• 输入框里仍是一个按钮（第 9 条已定合并）：模型名 + 推理强度。点开先到推理强度页，模型列表是浮层里的第二页。",
          "lineHeight": 1.6,
          "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
          "fontSize": 13,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "n0rjR",
          "name": "P",
          "fill": "#a1a1a8",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "• 推理强度：顶部居中显示当前档和模型名（带 ›）。滑块用方案 B：30px 胶囊轨道，填充由浅到深渐变，白色旋钮嵌在轨道里，档位是轨道上的凹点，拖动吸附到档位；点刻度或方向键即时生效，浮层不关，Esc 或点外面关闭。",
          "lineHeight": 1.6,
          "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
          "fontSize": 13,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "oSPPt",
          "name": "P",
          "fill": "#a1a1a8",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "• 恢复默认：回到跟随 Main 连接里保存的推理强度。此时标题显示连接的那一档并带「默认」小标签，滑块停在那一档，按钮隐藏。按钮上显示实际生效的档位（实现时改定：不显示「自动」，2026-11-12）。连接也没有保存档位时才显示「自动」。",
          "lineHeight": 1.6,
          "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
          "fontSize": 13,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "bV5DI",
          "name": "P",
          "fill": "#a1a1a8",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "• 选择模型：同一浮层换页，‹ 返回；当前项打勾，连接的默认模型标「默认」。选中后回到推理强度页。",
          "lineHeight": 1.6,
          "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
          "fontSize": 13,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "Lz215",
          "name": "P",
          "fill": "#a1a1a8",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "• 只影响当前会话，与现在一致；新会话继承上次选的模型。",
          "lineHeight": 1.6,
          "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
          "fontSize": 13,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "p7TaqA",
          "name": "P",
          "fill": "#a1a1a8",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "• 键盘：滑块是 role=slider（←→ 调档，Home/End 到两端）；模型列表 ↑↓ 选择、Enter 确认、← 或 Esc 返回。",
          "lineHeight": 1.6,
          "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
          "fontSize": 13,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "vJXvi",
          "name": "P",
          "fill": "#a1a1a8",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "• 档位随模型（用户已定，2026-11-12），来源按顺序：① 服务商 /models 接口返回的模型配置——reasoning_levels、supported_reasoning_levels[].effort、reasoning:false 等，按模型；② 连接地址与 Pi 内置模型表里某厂商同主机时，按该厂商下这个模型 ID 查；③ 都没有时在连接设置里自己勾选（默认全选、至少一项，按连接）。",
          "lineHeight": 1.6,
          "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
          "fontSize": 13,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "quVpA",
          "name": "P",
          "fill": "#a1a1a8",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "• 输入框滑块只显示支持的档位，刻度数随模型变化。换模型后原档位不支持时，取最接近的一档（Pi clampThinkingLevel），浮层底部说明一次。",
          "lineHeight": 1.6,
          "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
          "fontSize": 13,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "mG0Cz",
          "name": "P",
          "fill": "#a1a1a8",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "• 连接默认的推理强度只能从支持的档位里选；「自动」仍表示跟随连接默认。",
          "lineHeight": 1.6,
          "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
          "fontSize": 13,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "QhB8l",
          "name": "P",
          "fill": "#a1a1a8",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "• 同一份 /models 配置里的上下文容量、输出上限、图像输入也一并识别，作为这个模型的默认值；连接里手动填过的值优先。",
          "lineHeight": 1.6,
          "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
          "fontSize": 13,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "Bwg8e",
          "name": "P",
          "fill": "#a1a1a8",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "• 档位以 Pi 支持的为准（关闭 / 最少 / 低 / 中 / 高 / 极高 / 最大），接口给出的其他档位直接忽略，不另行说明。",
          "lineHeight": 1.6,
          "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
          "fontSize": 13,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        }
      ]
    },
