    {
      "type": "frame",
      "id": "CuF0q",
      "x": 3080,
      "y": 17200,
      "name": "说明 · 打磨 32",
      "width": 440,
      "fill": "#1c1c20",
      "cornerRadius": 12,
      "layout": "vertical",
      "gap": 10,
      "padding": 24,
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "S18d7n",
          "name": "H",
          "fill": "#ededef",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "打磨 32 · 新建会话入口（待确认）",
          "lineHeight": 1.6,
          "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
          "fontSize": 16,
          "fontWeight": "600"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "DHmlj",
          "name": "P1",
          "fill": "#a1a1a8",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "• 一个主入口：侧栏顶部「新会话 ⌘K」。会话建在当前选中的项目里（侧栏高亮的那个；没有选中时用最近用过的项目）。新会话页输入框左下的项目标签显示归属，发送前可以改。",
          "lineHeight": 1.6,
          "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
          "fontSize": 13,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "IqmKm",
          "name": "P2",
          "fill": "#a1a1a8",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "• 在指定项目里新建：项目行悬停出现「+」，直接在该项目新建；旁边的「⋯」是项目菜单（重命名 / 移除）。窄窗图标栏的项目浮层保留同一个「+」。",
          "lineHeight": 1.6,
          "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
          "fontSize": 13,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "pEJMH",
          "name": "P3",
          "fill": "#a1a1a8",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "• 搜索移进侧栏，放在「新会话」下一行：「搜索 ⌘P」。",
          "lineHeight": 1.6,
          "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
          "fontSize": 13,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "xQn2M",
          "name": "P4",
          "fill": "#a1a1a8",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "• 顶栏（A，侧栏展开）：只留红绿灯、侧栏开关、后退 / 前进；去掉搜索和新会话两个图标，避免和侧栏重复。",
          "lineHeight": 1.6,
          "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
          "fontSize": 13,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "DKS9i",
          "name": "P5",
          "fill": "#a1a1a8",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "• 顶栏（B，侧栏收起）：侧栏看不见时，搜索和新会话图标出现在顶栏，行为与侧栏的两项相同。",
          "lineHeight": 1.6,
          "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
          "fontSize": 13,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "T51XL",
          "name": "P6",
          "fill": "#a1a1a8",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "• 快捷键不变：⌘K 新会话，⌘P 搜索。图标按钮与侧栏按钮同名（「新会话」「搜索」），快捷键写在 aria-keyshortcuts。",
          "lineHeight": 1.6,
          "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
          "fontSize": 13,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "K6yDqM",
          "name": "P7",
          "fill": "#a1a1a8",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "• 待确认：⌘K 是否改成 ⌘N。⌘N 是桌面应用的常见习惯，但浏览器里会新开窗口，Web 版用不了，所以建议保持 ⌘K。",
          "lineHeight": 1.6,
          "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
          "fontSize": 13,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "frame",
