          "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
          "fontSize": 13,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "rNBq6",
          "name": "Line",
          "fill": "#C9C9CF",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "• 参照主流做法（Cherry Studio、LobeChat、Cursor）：先配「供应商」，再给角色选「模型」。原来「一个连接一个模型」改为「一个供应商多个模型」。",
          "lineHeight": 1.55,
          "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
          "fontSize": 13,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "hnPLg",
          "name": "Line",
          "fill": "#C9C9CF",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "• A 供应商：左列供应商列表（状态点：绿=已连接、黄=校验失败、灰=未启用）；右侧填 API Key、API 地址、接口格式（Chat Completions / Responses / Anthropic Messages），下方显示请求地址预览。「检查」验证 Key 和地址。",
          "lineHeight": 1.55,
          "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
          "fontSize": 13,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "w6paA3",
          "name": "Line",
          "fill": "#C9C9CF",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "• 模型列表：「获取模型列表」从 /models 拉取，也可手动添加。每行显示能力标签（推理/视觉/工具、上下文长度），被角色使用时显示角色标签。",
          "lineHeight": 1.55,
          "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
          "fontSize": 13,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "YFDql",
          "name": "Line",
          "fill": "#C9C9CF",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "• 齿轮打开单个模型的高级参数：上下文、输出上限、推理档位、图片输入、缓存键、思考格式。接口返回的值标「自动」，可手动覆盖，也可恢复自动值。",
          "lineHeight": 1.55,
          "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
          "fontSize": 13,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "oRWKh",
          "name": "Line",
          "fill": "#C9C9CF",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "• B 角色分配：Main / Executor / Reviewer 各选一个模型（按供应商分组、可搜索、带能力标签），旁边选推理强度，可选档位来自该模型。连接异常的供应商整组置灰。",
          "lineHeight": 1.55,
          "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
          "fontSize": 13,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "TapD2",
          "name": "Line",
          "fill": "#C9C9CF",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "• 不设项目覆盖：单个会话换模型在对话面板选择；这个位置留给后续的自定义 Agent（路线图 P6.5）。",
          "lineHeight": 1.55,
          "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
          "fontSize": 13,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "S4GLIr",
          "name": "Line",
          "fill": "#C9C9CF",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "• 范围：这需要后端新增供应商实体与存储结构，对应路线图「独立排期 · 模型供应商配置」。产品未发布，旧连接不做迁移。",
          "lineHeight": 1.55,
          "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
          "fontSize": 13,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "osGzR",
          "name": "Line",
          "fill": "#C9C9CF",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "已确认（2026-11-17）：两个标签页的结构；后端供应商实体已实现；预置按「中国 / 国际 / 本地与自定义」分组，国内厂商同时提供国际版 API。",
          "lineHeight": 1.55,
          "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
          "fontSize": 13,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        }
      ]
    },
