    {
      "type": "frame",
      "id": "Zkgfp",
      "x": 3080,
      "y": 24420,
      "name": "说明 · P4.7 Agent、技能与 MCP",
      "theme": {
        "mode": "dark"
      },
      "width": 460,
      "fill": "#1C1C20",
      "cornerRadius": 14,
      "layout": "vertical",
      "gap": 10,
      "padding": 22,
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "VpuOE",
          "name": "Title",
          "fill": "#EDEDEF",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "P4.7 · 界面设计说明",
          "lineHeight": 1.55,
          "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
          "fontSize": 16,
          "fontWeight": "600"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "WJmqN",
          "name": "Line",
          "fill": "#C9C9CF",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "设置页新增三项导航：Agent、技能、MCP，排在「模型与角色」之后，沿用左列表 + 右详情的布局。",
          "lineHeight": 1.55,
          "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
          "fontSize": 13,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "l6t3CR",
          "name": "Line",
          "fill": "#C9C9CF",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "技能：顶部切换「全局 / 项目」，和 Agent 一致。全局列出本产品 ~/.atria/skills、通用 ~/.agents/skills 与自带技能，用标签和筛选区分来源；项目页先选项目，列出 .atria/skills 与 .agents/skills。本产品安装的可检查更新、删除；任何技能都能「从索引移除」，只改产品索引不动文件，可在「已从索引移除」里恢复。列表分页。",
          "lineHeight": 1.55,
          "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
          "fontSize": 13,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "WjBqU",
          "name": "Line",
          "fill": "#C9C9CF",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "添加技能：Git 地址 / 本地文件夹 / 压缩包，读取后勾选要装的技能，只装到 ~/.atria/skills。",
          "lineHeight": 1.55,
          "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
          "fontSize": 13,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "A4rymx",
          "name": "Line",
          "fill": "#C9C9CF",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "MCP：只有全局一份 ~/.atria/mcp.json，所有项目共用，不分项目。列表按状态筛选并分页，状态点区分已连接 / 需要登录 / 失败 / 停用。详情含连接配置和每个工具的可见方式；哪个 Agent 用哪些服务，在 Agent 编辑页里选。添加服务支持本地命令、远程地址、粘贴 JSON，保存前可测试连接。",
          "lineHeight": 1.55,
          "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
          "fontSize": 13,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "i0398N",
          "name": "Line",
          "fill": "#C9C9CF",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Agent：顶部切换「全局 / 项目」。内置 executor、reviewer 只读可复制。编辑页左列名称、使用说明、权限（可写 / 只读）、模型，右列工具、技能、MCP，底部附加提示词；只读时写入类工具置灰。项目页先选项目，显示信任状态、项目 Agent 和此项目可用的全局 Agent。 列表分页。",
          "lineHeight": 1.55,
          "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
          "fontSize": 13,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "cUedY",
          "name": "Line",
          "fill": "#C9C9CF",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "输入框：/ 列出技能、指令模板和命令；@ 列出项目文件、Agent 和 MCP 资源。选中后成为标签，随消息以结构化字段发送。",
          "lineHeight": 1.55,
          "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
          "fontSize": 13,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "z1Wbwf",
          "name": "Line",
          "fill": "#C9C9CF",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Main 创建 Agent：对话里出现定义卡片，用户确认后才写文件；也可跳到设置修改或直接回复修改意见。",
          "lineHeight": 1.55,
          "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
          "fontSize": 13,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "y95H2J",
          "name": "Line",
          "fill": "#C9C9CF",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "信任项目：项目首次带有 .atria/agents 或技能时弹出，列出将要生效的内容。",
          "lineHeight": 1.55,
          "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
          "fontSize": 13,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        }
      ]
    },
