    {
      "type": "frame",
      "id": "QOBEA",
      "x": 6160,
      "y": 26520,
      "name": "说明 · P4.8 提问与确认",
      "width": 460,
      "fill": "#1A1A1E",
      "cornerRadius": 16,
      "layout": "vertical",
      "gap": 12,
      "padding": 28,
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "yXs5G",
          "name": "H",
          "fill": "#EDEDEF",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "提问与确认：统一停在输入框的位置",
          "lineHeight": 1.65,
          "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
          "fontSize": 18,
          "fontWeight": "600"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "D5zjPF",
          "name": "P",
          "fill": "#A1A1A8",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "1. 三种卡片（Main 提问、确认票、确认 Agent）都不再插在对话流里，而是占住输入框的位置。Main 在等你，输入框本来也用不了，问题就该出现在你要回答的地方。回答后卡片收起，对话里只留一行「你选了什么」。",
          "lineHeight": 1.65,
          "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "hjnwy",
          "name": "P",
          "fill": "#A1A1A8",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "2. 提问：数字键直接选，回车发送；最后一项「其他回答」就是输入框。推荐项带标签，右上角倒计时说明超时会按推荐继续。",
          "lineHeight": 1.65,
          "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "dxRuy",
          "name": "P",
          "fill": "#A1A1A8",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "3. 多选：问题旁标「可多选」，圆点换成方框，底部显示已选几项。推荐可以是多项。",
          "lineHeight": 1.65,
          "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "bJj5q",
          "name": "P",
          "fill": "#A1A1A8",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "4. 确认票：标题右边一行看清先后（01 → 02 + 03 同时做）；每张票默认收起，只显示改动范围和验收条数，点开看验收标准、保留不变、本次不做。修改已确认的票时，改过的字段加「已修改」。",
          "lineHeight": 1.65,
          "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "OuoMf",
          "name": "P",
          "fill": "#A1A1A8",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "5. 确认 Agent：名字、用途、文件路径一行；范围、权限、模型、工具、MCP、技能压成两行；提示词默认收起。",
          "lineHeight": 1.65,
          "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "CqJca",
          "name": "P",
          "fill": "#A1A1A8",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "6. 确认类卡片底部统一：修改意见输入框 + 拒绝 + 确认。",
          "lineHeight": 1.65,
          "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "tVGAm",
          "name": "P",
          "fill": "#A1A1A8",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "7. 多个问题：顶部一排步骤，答过的打勾并显示答案，点任意一步可回去改。底部「上一个 / 下一个」，最后一步变成「发送」，全部回答完一起发给 Main；超时的话没答的按推荐。",
          "lineHeight": 1.65,
          "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        }
      ]
    },
